# A loop layer of its own length (LOOP's ALGO): a layer of one note in a four-beat loop comes round every
# six beats when set to six (a rest after it), every two when set to two (its end cut), as the loop again
# when set back. Eight voices: eight keys held, eight notes.
wait 1000
tap REC
tapkey w2
wait 2600
tap REC
wait 100
expect looper 2
tap SEL
wait 100
turn ALGO 2
wait 100
expect lay18 6
expect set_bpm 90
shot loop_len.png
wait 2000
expect vox_notes <99
wait 16000
expect vox_notes 4
turn ALGO -4
wait 100
expect lay18 2
wait 2000
expect vox_notes <99
wait 16000
expect vox_notes 12
turn ALGO 2
wait 100
expect lay18 0
tap HOME
key w1 down
key w2 down
key w3 down
key w4 down
key w5 down
key w6 down
key w7 down
key w8 down
wait 200
expect voices_on 8
key w1 up
key w2 up
key w3 up
key w4 up
key w5 up
key w6 up
key w7 up
key w8 up
expect clips 0
